# TypeScript path aliases (Frontend)

Prefer configured path aliases over `../` climbs. Same-folder `./` is fine.

| Alias | Maps to | Use for |
|-------|---------|---------|
| `@/*` | `App/*` | App modules (`@/Components`, `@/Views/...`, `@/Icons`, …) |
| `api` / `api/*` | federated remote types | GraphQL hooks/types from `api/provider` |
| `^/*` | repo root | Rare cross-package paths outside App |

```ts
// ❌
import { labelFor } from '../tree';
import { Button } from '../../../Components';

// ✅
import { labelFor } from '@/Views/Experiments/TreeOfLife/tree';
import { Button } from '@/Components';
import { TaxonVisualStatus, useKicl_TaxonVisual } from 'api/provider';
```

When editing imports, rewrite reachable relatives to the matching alias in the same change.

**Exception:** Vite/bootstrap config under `App/.Client` and `App/.Server` may keep relatives for JSON/config loaded before aliases exist (e.g. `getAlias.ts` → `../../tsconfig.json`).
